  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 810031e0539baf849a8ec048a6ff4b7a, type: 3}
  m_Name: help_queen
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Antarium.Content::Antarium.Content.HelpTopicDef
  id: help_queen
  displayName: The queen and eggs
  order: 170
  category: Basics
  icon: eggs
  body: 'While there is food, the queen lays an egg every few seconds. Each egg costs food and hatches into an ant. Only a few eggs can wait next to her at once.


    Click the queen or press {Queen} for her panel: how fast she lays, her eggs, what the colony eats, and her evolutions, which you buy with rare finds such as honeydew and amber.


    Stop laying in her panel tells her to rest, for when the colony has as many ants as your food can feed. Resume laying starts her again.


    Raiders in the royal chamber stop her laying too. Honeydew from an Aphid Ranch makes her lay faster.'
  reveal: 0
  revealBiome: {fileID: 0}
  revealResearch: {fileID: 0}
